# Contributing to ${title}

You need GNU Make, curl, tar, sha256sum, the MIPS binutils and, only for toolchains that assemble with it, armips.
Tool commands default to conventional names. Put other paths in `local.mk`.

Place your own big-endian cartridge dumps at these paths:

${roms}

`make check` builds every version and verifies each ROM's SHA-1.
The compilers and the other pinned tools are downloaded into `tools/` and checked against their pinned hashes.
